    
   . Program finds all prime numbers ≤ N (user input).
   . Uses only while loops.
   . Starts checking from 2 (smallest prime).
   . For each number up to N:
   . ssume it is prime.
   . Check divisibility from 2 to √number.
   . If divisible, mark as not prime.
   . Prints all prime numbers found.
   . Save as prime_finder.py.
   . Run using python prime_finder.py.
   . Input N when prompted.
   . Output: list of prime numbers ≤ N.